 abstract = {This paper presents a novel framework for integrating blockchain technology with artificial intelligence to enhance data security in IoT ecosystems. We propose a decentralized model that leverages smart contracts for secure data sharing and machine learning algorithms for anomaly detection. Experimental results on real-world datasets demonstrate improved efficiency and robustness against cyber threats compared to traditional centralized approaches.},
