@article{lee_llm-based_2025,
 abstract = {A Novel Approach to Enhancing Data Integration in Heterogeneous Environments Using Machine Learning Techniques

In the era of big data, integrating information from diverse and heterogeneous sources remains a significant challenge. This paper proposes a novel framework that leverages advanced machine learning algorithms to improve the accuracy and efficiency of data integration processes. By combining deep neural networks for schema matching and reinforcement learning for query optimization, our approach addresses key issues such as semantic heterogeneity and scalability. Experimental results on benchmark datasets demonstrate a 25% improvement in integration precision compared to traditional methods, highlighting the potential for real-world applications in enterprise systems and IoT ecosystems.},
