 abstract = {In this paper, we propose a novel framework for efficient data workflow management in distributed environments. Our approach integrates machine learning techniques to optimize query processing and resource allocation, achieving up to 40% improvement in performance over existing methods. We evaluate our system on real-world datasets and demonstrate its scalability in cloud-based deployments.},
