 abstract = {This paper proposes a novel framework for adaptive control in multi-agent systems under uncertain environments. By integrating reinforcement learning with model predictive control, the approach enables real-time decision-making while ensuring stability and robustness. Simulation results demonstrate superior performance compared to traditional methods in terms of convergence speed and error reduction.},
