 abstract = {Artificial Intelligence in Agriculture is an open access journal that publishes original research articles and reviews on the application of artificial intelligence (AI) and related technologies in agriculture. The journal covers a wide range of topics, including but not limited to: AI for crop management, livestock monitoring, precision farming, agricultural robotics, data analytics in agribusiness, and sustainable agricultural practices enabled by AI. The aim is to advance the understanding and application of AI to address global food security challenges, improve productivity, and promote environmentally friendly farming practices.},
