 abstract = {This study investigates the role of artificial intelligence in enhancing cybersecurity measures within financial institutions. By analyzing data from over 500 global banks, we identify key vulnerabilities and propose a novel AI-driven framework for real-time threat detection and mitigation. Our results demonstrate a 40% reduction in breach incidents, highlighting the transformative potential of AI in safeguarding digital assets.},
