 abstract = {This chapter proposes a novel framework for enhancing cybersecurity in smart grids using machine learning algorithms. The proposed system integrates anomaly detection techniques with blockchain technology to ensure secure and reliable data transmission. Experimental results demonstrate a significant improvement in detection accuracy and response time compared to traditional methods. The framework is evaluated on real-world datasets, showing robustness against various cyber threats.},
