 publisher = {IEEE Press},
 series = {{ICSE}},
 title = {Trust {Dynamics}},
 url = {https://doi.org/10.1109/icse55347.2025.00199},
 we conducted a mixed-method study consisting of an in-depth exploratory survey with (n = {29) developers followed by an observation study (n=10).We found that comprehensibility and perceived correctness were the most frequently used factors to evaluate code suggestion trustworthiness. However},
 we extracted four guidelines to enhance developer-ai interactions. we validated the guidelines through a survey with (n = {7) domain experts and survey members (n=8). We discuss the validated guidelines},
