 abstract = {This paper proposes a novel framework for enhancing software security in cloud environments through advanced encryption techniques and machine learning-based anomaly detection. We evaluate our approach on real-world datasets, demonstrating a 30% improvement in threat detection accuracy compared to existing methods. The framework is designed to be scalable and integrable with popular cloud platforms such as AWS and Azure.},
