@article{yuan_rag-driver_2024,
 abstract = {We present Grok, a new large language model from xAI. Grok is designed to answer questions with a bit of wit and has a rebellious streak, so please don’t use it if you hate humor!

A unique and fundamental advantage of Grok is that it has real-time knowledge of the world via the 𝕏 platform. It will also answer spicy questions that are rejected by most other AI systems. Grok is still a very early beta product – best we could do with 2 months of training – so expect it to improve rapidly with each passing week with your help.

At launch, Grok will be available to 𝕏 Premium+ subscribers. Visit x.ai for more details.},
