 abstract = {This paper proposes a novel framework for enhancing the semantic understanding of multimedia content through the integration of knowledge graphs and deep learning techniques. We introduce a multi-modal knowledge graph embedding model that captures both visual and textual features to improve content recommendation systems. Experimental results on benchmark datasets demonstrate significant improvements in accuracy and efficiency compared to existing methods.},
