 abstract = {This paper proposes a novel framework for optimizing supply chain management using blockchain technology. By integrating smart contracts and IoT devices, the system ensures transparency, reduces fraud, and enhances efficiency in real-time tracking of goods. Simulation results demonstrate a 30% improvement in operational costs and delivery times compared to traditional methods. The approach is validated through case studies in the logistics industry.},
