 abstract = {This paper proposes a novel framework for enhancing cybersecurity in IoT ecosystems through adaptive machine learning models. We introduce a hybrid approach combining federated learning with blockchain for secure data sharing among distributed devices. Experimental results on benchmark datasets demonstrate a 25% improvement in threat detection accuracy while reducing latency by 15%. The framework addresses key challenges such as privacy preservation and scalability, making it suitable for real-world deployments in smart cities and industrial applications.},
